    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d411">

                <pb facs="0534" n="426" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg426"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Ornelas to
                        Señor Cayetano Romero.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Antonio, Tex.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-12-14"><hi rendition="#italic">December 14,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Col. Ceron telegraphs me as follows: “Sixteen Mexican soldiers, captured on the
                    10th and brought over by the raiders, are imprisoned at San Ignacio, Tex.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">P. Ornelas.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
